{"sym":"BP.L","v":2,"about":{"summary":"BP p.l.c., an integrated energy company, engages in the oil and gas business worldwide. The company operates through Gas & Low Carbon Energy, Oil Production & Operations, and Customers & Products segments. It engages in the production of natural gas, marketing, and trading activities, as well as solar, wind, and hydrogen businesses. The company also offers aviation fuel products and services, such as jet fuel; aviation gasoline; UL91 aviation fuel; and sustainable aviation fuel. In addition, it engages in the convenience and retail fuel; EV charging; Castrol lubricants and fluids; B2B; midstream; crude oil production; refining and oil trading; and bioenergy businesses. The company was founded in 1908 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","lead":"BP p.l.c., an integrated energy company, engages in the oil and gas business worldwide. The company operates through Gas & Low Carbon Energy, Oil Production & Operations, and Customers & Products segments.","web":"https://www.bp.com","ir":"http://www.bp.com/sectionbodycopy.do?categoryId=132&contentId=7063897","emp":93700,"city":"London","country":"United Kingdom"},"officers":[{"n":"Ms. Katherine Anne Thomson","t":"CFO & Director","age":57,"yb":1968,"pay":2641000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Murray Auchincloss","t":"Advisor","age":55,"yb":1970,"pay":4504600,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Marguerite Eileen O'Neill B.Sc., M.Sc.","t":"CEO & Director","age":55,"yb":1970,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Emeka Emembolu","t":"Executive Vice President of Technology","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Craig Marshall C.M.A.","t":"Group Head of Investor Relations","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Mike Sosso","t":"Executive Vice President of Legal","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Sonya Adams","t":"EVP of People & Culture and CHRO","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Anthony Harbridge","t":"Head of Executive Office, Alternative Energy & Regions","fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Spencer Dale","t":"Group Chief Economist","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Jan Lyons","t":"Senior Vice President